# panel-knowledge-combined image context ignore list
#
# build.sh rsyncs panel/ (team-memory-control) + knowledge/ (services/knowledge)
# into a temporary context directory; this file takes effect in that context.
# Purpose: avoid baking sensitive real values / internal-network info / large files into the image.

# ── Real-value config: must be mounted at runtime, not baked into the image ──
# metadata-instances.json contains the tdai kernel Bearer token; see the deployment section of the panel README.
panel/config/metadata-instances.json
panel/config/*.yaml
panel/config/*.yml
panel/.env
panel/.env.*
knowledge/.env
knowledge/.env.*

# ── Docs: not required at runtime, and contain internal path references ──
# Exclude both layers of docs/. The only spec needed at runtime is knowledge/openapi.yaml (package root,
# read by src/server.ts for Swagger UI); it is not under docs/ and is unaffected.
panel/docs/
knowledge/docs/

# ── Test scripts: contain hardcoded internal-environment paths, not required at runtime ──
panel/tests/
panel/e2e-*.sh
knowledge/__tests__/
knowledge/bin/e2e-*.sh

# ── Dependencies / build artifacts ──
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.git
**/logs
**/*.log
**/data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite

# ── Editor/OS clutter ──
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.iwiki
**/.codebuddy
